 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Although: indicative and subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "With **anche se** + indicative you normally present the fact as real: **Anche se piove, esco**. With the subjunctive it can be hypothetical: **Anche se piovesse, uscirei** (even if it were raining, I would go out). **Sebbene** and **benché** usually take the subjunctive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nonostante and per quanto",
     "texto": [
      "**Nonostante** can go with a noun (**nonostante la pioggia**) or with **che** + subjunctive (**nonostante piova**). **Per quanto** + subjunctive: **Per quanto studi, non passo** (however much he studies, he doesn't pass)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
